{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dick Shortson \u2013 The Detective.</strong><br>You've been hired by a woman to find her missing mother. You've been hired by a woman to find her missing mother. Grab your gun and uncover the secrets hidden in another godforsaken village. Shoot, solve puzzles, and catch the vibe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a first-person shooter</strong> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890110/extras/9a5ff27354ef34b15b6fc78e75509c7b.poster.avif?t=1767021182\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890110/extras/9a5ff27354ef34b15b6fc78e75509c7b.webm?t=1767021182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890110/extras/9a5ff27354ef34b15b6fc78e75509c7b.mp4?t=1767021182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>inspired by old-school games, where the control system was often your biggest enemy.<br> <strong>Every weapon in the game is deadly</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890110/extras/a54733ad933ac1e38176716d50b04cd8.poster.avif?t=1767021182\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890110/extras/a54733ad933ac1e38176716d50b04cd8.webm?t=1767021182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890110/extras/a54733ad933ac1e38176716d50b04cd8.mp4?t=1767021182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> \u2014 every shot could be your last, or your enemy\u2019s. <br><strong>Think twice before pulling the trigger.</strong> You're not a walking ammo dispenser, and Dick Shortson is far from the best gunslinger \u2014 maybe even the worst.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Look around</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890110/extras/5fdc9c3bb3fda8861567fa71e5848f72.poster.avif?t=1767021182\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890110/extras/5fdc9c3bb3fda8861567fa71e5848f72.webm?t=1767021182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890110/extras/5fdc9c3bb3fda8861567fa71e5848f72.mp4?t=1767021182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> \u2014 there might be a way forward that doesn\u2019t involve violence. Or just charge in headfirst.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>The game takes place in an old village.</strong><br> A decaying little vilage \u2014 all the young people have long since moved to the cities, leaving behind only the elderly and those not too strong of mind or dependent on various substances. A perfect breeding ground for anyone looking to impose their ideas on others, isn\u2019t it?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890110/extras/133982051031cfbec9c361aa269061bf.poster.avif?t=1767021182\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890110/extras/133982051031cfbec9c361aa269061bf.webm?t=1767021182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890110/extras/133982051031cfbec9c361aa269061bf.mp4?t=1767021182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, you want to shoot a bit, think a little, and vibe with stylized graphics? Then this detective adventure is for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3890110?t=1767021182","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3890110?t=1767021182","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890110/6886de0cf34c184d8b9b91f03a98c8f4c0e9ac73/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767021182","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890110/6886de0cf34c184d8b9b91f03a98c8f4c0e9ac73/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767021182","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This is a shooter game featuring intense violence, including gunfights, stabbings, and death. You will also see depictions of alcohol (e.g., beer bottles), and some NPCs may share stories about how drug use ruined their lives. Player can vape."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dick Shortson \u2013 The Detective.</strong><br>You've been hired by a woman to find her missing mother. You've been hired by a woman to find her missing mother. Grab your gun and uncover the secrets hidden in another godforsaken village. Shoot, solve puzzles, and catch the vibe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a first-person shooter</strong> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890110/extras/9a5ff27354ef34b15b6fc78e75509c7b.poster.avif?t=1767021182\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890110/extras/9a5ff27354ef34b15b6fc78e75509c7b.webm?t=1767021182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/