lage \u2014 all the young people have long since moved to the cities, leaving behind only the elderly and those not too strong of mind or dependent on various substances. A perfect breeding ground for anyone looking to impose their ideas on others, isn\u2019t it?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890110/extras/133982051031cfbec9c361aa269061bf.poster.avif?t=1767021182\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890110/extras/133982051031cfbec9c361aa269061bf.webm?t=1767021182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890110/extras/133982051031cfbec9c361aa269061bf.mp4?t=1767021182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, you want to shoot a bit, think a little, and vibe with stylized graphics? Then this detective adventure is for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["UnderBeerGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890110/f1edacb9d1374132c70182e93f7d39ecdb3a6dc3/header.jpg?t=1767021182","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3890110/341000428/933c28ba798d2a3ca51f010b3f27c5d8aaf33152/1752930829/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753275510","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3890110/341000428/933c28ba798d2a3ca51f010b3